'''Tag Arena Challenge''' (タッグ闘技チャレンジ, ''Taggu Tōgi Charenji'', '''Tag Team Challenge''') is a map added in [[Version 11.6 Update|Version 11.6]]. It consists of all [[Tag Arena Stages]] combined into a single map, along with three new stages. Progress made in Tag Arena Challenge will reset when the event ends.

==About==
There are three stages per map, each with a Cat Deploy Limit and enemy limit of 2. Taking over 15 minutes to beat any stage will cause an [[Assassin Bear]] to spawn. As opposed to the [[Duel Stages Challenge]], most of the enemies can spawn multiple times.

